      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774981471594,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- I need a reference to the last node in the list -> O(1)\n- If the list is empty, both the head and tail must point to it\n- If the list is not empty, the tail's next node must be the new node\n- Move the tail pointer to the new node, the tail must point to the new node",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- I need a reference to the last node in the list -> O(1)\n- If the list is empty, both the head and tail must point to it\n- If the list is not empty, the tail's next node must be the new node\n- Move the tail pointer to the new node, the tail must point to the new node",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
