      "versionNonce": 1320696162,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1774988117283,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- I need a temporal reference to the prev node to delete a node at index n\n- If the list has one node, I mean head.next equal nil, the head and tail must be nil\n- If the node to remove is the head, the head must point to the old head's next node\n- If the node to remove is the tail, the tail must point to the prev node\n- If the list has more than one node, the prev's next node must point to the current's next node",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- I need a temporal reference to the prev node to delete a node at index n\n- If the list has one node, I mean head.next equal nil, the head and tail must be nil\n- If the node to remove is the head, the head must point to the old head's next node\n- If the node to remove is the tail, the tail must point to the prev node\n- If the list has more than one node, the prev's next node must point to the current's next node",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
